# AGENTS.md - {{ project_name }}

This file is the entry point for AI coding assistants working on this repository. It is an index to detailed topic guides in the `.agents/` and `.attunic/` directories. Read each file in [Topics](#topics) when its `When to read` entry applies; you don't need to load all of them.

A file with `Project-specific` markers holds two kinds of content:

- Project-owned content: the content below a `Project-specific` marker, until the end of file or the next Markdown heading that has as many or fewer `#` than the marker's section heading or has a `Project-specific` marker of its own.
- Template-owned content: everything else in the file.

